<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπι-βαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mount together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				591b21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τείχους</span>
			<i>on</i> the wall, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				4
			</span></i>; <i>mount a ladder together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.13.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>enter upon</i> or <i>undertake along with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.2.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>trample on as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐν ταῖς συμφοραῖς τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.24.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> trans.,
				aor. 1
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βήσας</span>, <i>cause to mount</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργοις ἀκοντιστάς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.7.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
